\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid9011029\charrsid9011029 1. The Core Variable: Tension vs. Rigidity
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9011029\charrsid9011029 The behavior of both the pen and the string is dictated by how quickly an introduced kinetic force can travel through the material.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\kerning2\insrsid9011029\charrsid9011029 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\sa160\sl278\slmult1\widctlpar
