In a solid plastic pen, the "tension" is replaced by the material's structural rigidity and elasticity (Young's Modulus). The wave velocity is incredibly high. Under normal conditions, any force you apply instantly travels through the entire object, makin
g it move as a rigid, solid unit.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sa160\sl278\slmult1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9011029 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid9011029\charrsid9011029 2. The Great Equalizer: The Loose Grip
